- Every character, environment, prop and device used in any shot has an entry. Nothing appears in a shot without one.
- Channel defaults from the launch decision: poses recoil, freeze, flee, asleep, standing, pointing, shrug, sitting, glancing back, cowering; environments night bedroom, night savannah with a fire, plain diagram plate, cliff edge, water, stage; props spider, snake, moon-phase bar, lion eyes in darkness, alarm meter, simple needle, crowd silhouettes, fire. Include only those this video uses, and add new ones as needed.
- Canonical descriptions are fixed once written. Changing one means regenerating every shot that uses it, so flag it to the user instead.

